      hu: ["Ipar: A Nemzeti Cementipar (INC) székhelye", "Helyszín: Az Apa-folyó torkolata a Paraguay-folyóba", "Természeti adottság: Híres mészkőbarlangok", "Megyén: Concepción", "Népesség: kb. 10 000 fő", "Közlekedés: Fontos folyami kikötő"],
      ro: ["Industrie: Sediul Industriei Naționale de Ciment (INC)", "Locație: Confluența râului Apa cu râul Paraguay", "Caracteristică naturală: Peșteri de calcar cunoscute", "Departament: Concepción", "Populație: aprox. 10.000 locuitori", "Transport: Port fluvial important"],
      en: ["Industry: HQ of the National Cement Industry (INC)", "Location: Mouth of the Apa River into the Paraguay River", "Natural feature: Famous limestone caves", "Department: Concepción", "Population: approx. 10,000", "Transport: Major river port"],
